abstract: >-
  Unrefereed analytic proof candidate for the sharp negative-type exponent of
  every finite Ptolemaic metric. Exact and symbolic checks support particular
  identities and witnesses, not formal or independent verification of the
  universal proof. Component licences and historical rights are mapped in
  LICENSES.md; the two licences do not apply indiscriminately to all files.
